      "id": "d33497f36c6aff59f900",
      "title": "New appointment to Māori language Commission",
      "content_text": "Dr Julian Wilcox has been appointed Chair of the Māori Language Commission for a three-year term, effective 5 October 2026. He brings extensive expertise in te reo Māori, governance, broadcasting and public-sector leadership. Acting Māori Development Minister Shane Jones also thanked outgoing Chair Professor Rawinia Higgins for her significant contribution to the revitalisation of te reo Māori.",
      "date_published": "2026-10-05T02:30:00Z",
